$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("Your fleet is under attack!  Win the battle by scoring points for your team.

Pick which team you start as by selecting your ship.  Choose a Rebel ship, and you'll fly with the Rebels.  Choose an Imperial one to fly with the Empire.  At any time during the mission, you can press $1$ to switch teams.  You'll now be allied with the opposite team, and your fighter will be swapped out for its opposite-faction equivalent.", 2743)
$end_multi_text
