$multi_text
 XSTR("Both sides have a squadron of bombers assigned to attack the enemy's corvettes and hardpoints, escorted by a squadron of interceptors.  Another squadron of interceptors defends each team's capital ship and corvettes.  A space superiority squadron flies general duty.  You can give orders to your team's space superiority squadron--use them to defend critical assets or destroy important targets!", 2758)
$end_multi_text
